What is the ones digit of the sum
<cmath>\lfloor \sqrt{1} \rfloor + \lfloor \sqrt{2} \rfloor + \lfloor \sqrt{3} \rfloor + \dots + \lfloor \sqrt{2025} \rfloor?</cmath>(Recall that <imath>\lfloor x \rfloor</imath> represents the greatest integer less than or equal to <imath>x</imath>.)

